          "source_text_sha256": "c94bf8085173bcb96b1e8e8e208ec7638184daab151eb888c5822ee96806cc41",
          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: A witness observed the movement of two orange light phenomena in the night sky; very likely a misidentification of two Thai lanterns.",
